{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05473","headline":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴赋得谟字 · 贺知章","name":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴赋得谟字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西学垂玄览，东堂发圣谟。\n天光烛武殿，时宰集鸿都。\n枯朽沾皇泽，翾飞舞帝梧。\n迹同游汗漫，荣是出泥涂。\n三叹承汤鼎，千欢接舜壶。\n微躯不可荅，空欲咏依蒲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺知章","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05473.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05473","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}